        "original_id": "726b6b35-faf3-5401-a11d-bbe357d062a1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Draiman, Terry Kath, James Pankow\n- Bands: Disturbed, Device, Chicago\n- Songs: \"Make Me Smile\"\n\nFacts:\n- Terry Kath was born on January 31, 1946, and died on January 23, 1978.\n- David Michael Draiman was born on March 13, 1973, and he is an American songwriter.\n- Terry Kath was an American musician and songwriter best known as the original guitarist, a lead singer, and a founding member of Chicago.\n- David Draiman is the vocalist for Disturbed and Device.\n- James Pankow wrote the song \"Make Me Smile\" for Chicago.\n- Terry Kath performed lead vocals on \"Make Me Smile.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
